      <property name="toolTip">
       <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;HMAC-SHA-256 key as 64 hex characters (32 bytes). When set, frames are authenticated encrypted (AES + HMAC-SHA-256) and frames that fail authentication are dropped. Needs an AES algorithm and an explicitly set encryption key that is different from this key. Leave blank to disable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
